Hi there! Some little bugs fixed here!

PATCH v.0.9.14 
- Minor bugs fixed on Nafilis Healing SFX;
- Minor bugs fixed on SFX GO GO icon;
- Minor bugs fixed on AI Oyster enemy (Water Province);
- Minor bugs fixed on chest at the Enlightened Forest (Wind Province);
- Some adjustments on Rumble feature on Xbox gamepad;
- Steam Achievements enabled.

Patch v 0.9.9

- Now the Evil Tree subboss spawn 1 monkey for each hero;
- Implementation of Save System;
- Now you can revive a hero during the Stage in-game.

Patch v 0.9.8

- Removed lot of barricades and decreased the amount of Mushrooms in the Forest stage;
- Enemies now show a health bar above their heads;
- Reworked the ability cooldown system;
- Heroes now show the cooldown timer on their base;
- Monkey now throw fewer bananas;
- Now heroes can regenerate health by getting closer to the Nafilis statue in the sanctuary;
- Now is possible to go back to the main menu from the Sanctuary.

Patch - Version 0.9.7:

- Reworked Monkey AI;
- Monkey are no longer affected by the wind blow attack from the Evil Tree;
- Evil Tree's root damage decreased;
- More improvements on Lizard AI;
- Removed heroes health regeneration;
- Tweaked heroes health value;
- Tweaked enemies attack damage;

Hey everyone!

We´re thrilled to announce that our Josh Journey is OUT now on Steam! Early Access launch today!

[previewyoutube=g2gqawI1oCI;full][/previewyoutube]

Early Access launch is about the first area (Wind Province) with five enemies and nine skills to master in the ability board (around 25% of the game).
Wind Province
- 1st Stage: Green Fields;
- 2nd Stage: Feather Village;
- Subboss: Small Evil Tree / Big Evil Tree;
- 3rd Stage: Enlightened Forest;
- Boss: Dark Josh;

- Swap Heroes System (you can swap heroes in-game);
- Evil Eye System;
- Ultimate System (for Josh);
- Cooldown System;
- Sanctuary;
- Recovering Heroes System (Masks Heroes);
- Ability Board: two (2) skills for each hero.”

The Full Version will contain around twenty enemies among four Provinces (Wind, Water, Desert and Industrial), together with twenty skills from the four heroes in the complete Ability Board. Besides that, there will be animated cutscenes between the provinces and new dialogues in-game to present the storytelling to the players.

In this way, we will make these features and the other areas available throughout the year.

During Early Access we will be completely connected to our players' feedbacks, seeking the best solutions and always listening to our community. We´re going to work hard to make updates and finalize the 4 Areas of the game: Wind, Water, Desert and Industrial Province.

That's it folks! We are excited about the Early Access launch! Now more than ever we are going to develop the game with you! Big cheers!

Hey everyone! We´ve been working hard in our game and we just uploaded our New Demo Version, just check it out and tell us what you think about it!

Bugs:
- Fixed bug where the language changes when you return to the main menu;

Gameplay Changes:
- Improvements on Evil Eye mechanics;
- Enemies hitboxes were increased;
- Improvements on Evil Small Tree AI;
- Input to enter in the Sanctuary just need to be pressed one time;
- Return to the map is automatic when you leave Sanctuary;
- Input was changed to Join in the heroes selection menu;
- The back input can be used to return to the main menu, when the heroes are cleared. 

https://store.steampowered.com/app/1383280/Josh_Journey_Darkness_Totems/

Hey everyone! We just updated our last Demo Version 0.9.2 ! We´ve changed some points including:

Gameplay Changes:
- Removed energy system, now the abilities are limited only by cooldown;
- Heroes no longer start the game with a ability;
- Evil Monkey can no longer attack while being hit;
- Enemies HP was slightly decreased;
- Evil Eye position was slightly lowered to be more easily hit;

Visit our page store and play our New Demo Version!
